Third-party material
--------------------

This repository does not vendor third-party source code or assets. Rust
dependencies are fetched by Cargo at build time and remain under their own
licenses (see Cargo.lock for the exact set).

crates/core/src/logging.rs implements the `civil_from_days` algorithm
described by Howard Hinnant in "chrono-Compatible Low-Level Date Algorithms"
(https://howardhinnant.github.io/date_algorithms.html).

Exchange-rate data is fetched at runtime from OpenExchangeRates, Coinbase and
CoinGecko. Use of those APIs is subject to each vendor's own terms of service.
